WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,690
While people are still stuck in the middle of the road

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,290
Seal my road first

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,900
Go find the person who left you and ran away

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:22,720
As long as you can move

5
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,420
Five cars are heading this way

6
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,420
Don't even think about entering Chachi.

7
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:34,020
You guys are guarding me. Who dares to break in and bite him?

8
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:40,250
Car full of goods

9
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:42,650
And they singled out this blocked road like mine.
